    <briefdescription>
<para>A clock source with construction time configurable start delay. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="structscc_1_1sc__clock__ext" kindref="compound">sc_clock_ext</ref> class extends the sc_core::sc_clock class to provide additional functionality, such as configuration via CCI. It allows users to specify the period, duty cycle, and start time of the generated clock . </para>
    </detaileddescription>
